Faculty-resident “co-learning”: a longitudinal exploration of an innovative model for faculty development in quality improvement. Acad Med. 2017;92(8):1151–1159. doi: 10.1097/ACM.0000000000001505. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 38. MacLeod A. The hidden curriculum: is it time to re-consider the concept? Med Teach. 2014;36(6):539–540. doi: 10.3109/0142159X.2014.907876. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 39. Hafferty FW. Beyond curriculum reform: confronting medicine''s hidden curriculum. Acad Med. 1998;73(4):403–407. doi: 10.1097/00001888-199804000-00013. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Supplementary Materials Click here for additional data file. (196KB, doc)',247,'2025-10-14 06:25:14','2025-10-14 06:25:14');
